WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.340
Calculating how many stitches to pick up
for cardigan bands can be a challenge.

2
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:11.580
Use the Knit it Now Band Pick up Tool
and get it right every time.

3
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.660
Too few stitches and the band's too short.

4
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:18.260
Too many stitches and
you get a rippled edge.

5
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.700
With the tool enter the gauge of the

6
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:24.540
stitch pattern that you'll
be using for your band.

7
00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.460
Enter the number of rows along the front

8
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:32.560
edge of your sweater and let
Knit it Now do the math for you.

